+/*
+ * DUMP: the USB2-only controller (DSDT USB4, QCOM0FEF, 0x0a200000) is not
+ * present in the running system; DSDT (live): its _STA is hard-coded to
+ * Zero (its eUSB2 reset would be GpioIo 9). usb_hs stays disabled
+ * (glymur.dtsi default). The front USB 2.0 Type-A port is behind the
+ * usb_mp hubs.
